            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(3) Effective May 23, 2010, an Escalation Adjustment will be determined by computing the percentage increase in CPI-W, between March 2009 and March 2010. If the percentage increase of the CPI-W minus the current year's GWI percentage is positive, 70% of net positive difference will be added to the 2010 GWI.",
