        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(9) The Escalation Adjustments are dependent upon the availability of the CPI-W in its present form and calculated on the same basis as the CPI-W for March 2004. In the event the Bureau of Labor Statistics changes the form or the basis of calculating the CPI-W, the Company and the Union agree to request the Bureau to make available, for the life of this Agreement, a CPI-W in its present form",
